# Project Conventions

## One React component per folder (A8)
Never put two React components in the same folder. A page-only child lives in `src/pages/<Page>/<Child>/index.tsx`, not inlined in the page `index.tsx` and not in `src/components/` until a second caller exists.

## Confirm before changing files (G3)
Before creating or editing any file, list every create/modify/delete (and any git branch) and **wait for confirmation**. See `.cursor/rules/confirm-before-edit.mdc`.

## PWA — Never Cache API (S8)
Workbox must use `NetworkOnly` for `/api/*` (including `/api/auth/*`). Auth and vault traffic always hit the network.

## Conventional Commits (S9)
`hook-commit-guard` blocks non-conforming messages.

| Prefix | When |
|-----|---|
| `feat:` | New feature |
| `fix:` | Bug fix |
| `chore:` | Tooling, deps, config |
| `refactor:` | Restructure without behavior change |
| `test:` | Tests |
| `docs:` | Documentation |
| `style:` | Formatting only |
| `perf:` | Performance |
| `build:` | Build / deps |
| `ci:` | CI |
| `revert:` | Revert |

```
# ✅ GOOD
feat: add cookie-based auth session

# ❌ BAD
updated stuff
```

## No `console.log` in Production Code (S10)
`console.log` / `warn` / `error` are not allowed in production-bound code. Development-only: `if (isDevelopment) console.debug(...)`.

## No Hardcoded Secrets (H6)
Never hardcode API keys, tokens, or passwords. Use `src/utils/env.ts` and `VITE_*` variables.

## Package Install Approval (H7)
`npm install` (no args) is allowed. `npm install <package>` requires user approval (`hook-dep-install`).

## Automated Hooks (G2)
Verdicts are non-negotiable. Do not disable hooks.

| Event | Hook |
|----|---|
| `preToolUse` | `hook-protect-env`, `hook-secret-scan` |
| `afterFileEdit` | `hook-format-and-lint`, `hook-style-guardrail` |
| `beforeShellExecution` | `hook-commit-guard`, `hook-branch-guard`, `hook-dep-install` |
| `stop` | `hook-readme-sync` |
